  "reviews": {
    "summary": "2 reviews\nJon Scott  recommends The Garden Barber Guernsey .\n\nNial did an absolutely amazing job in our complex layered garden. Not only did he sort years of weeds out but trimmed all the bushes and hedges back so we could see the views of the beautiful sea again. Not only is he passionate but he’s ultimately professional, considerate and punctual / reliable.  I wouldn’t hesitate recommending him and his business to anyone. Fantastic all round and clear charging. Best I’ve used for many years. T",
    "items": [
      {
        "text": "Nial did an absolutely amazing job in our complex layered garden. Not only did he sort years of weeds out but trimmed all the bushes and hedges back so we could see the views of the beautiful sea again. Not only is he passionate but he’s ultimately professional, considerate and punctual / reliable.  I wouldn’t hesitate recommending him and his business to anyone. Fantastic all round and clear charging. Best I’ve used for many years. Thanks Nial.",
        "author": "Jon Scott",
        "recommends": true,
        "headline": "Jon Scott recommends The Garden Barber Guernsey ."
      }
    ]
  },
  "posts": [
    {
